label Greeting
Buboy: Hehe! [pause=1.0]
Buboy: Stay there, *Damulag*!
Buboy: Don't eat the grass here, okay?
Buboy: *Manang* might get mad!
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: Hi *Kuya*!
Buboy: Mama told me to buy something...
Buboy: But I forgot what it was called again!
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: But I remember what it looks like!
Buboy: It's the one that [color=#0bb544][pulse]{Transaction.ItemHint}[/pulse][/color].
Buboy: Do you have that one?

label Talk
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: Are you still looking for it?
Buboy: My *Damulag* is getting sleepy!
Buboy: Hehe!
- Sige, wait lang.
	Player: Okay Buboy, just wait a bit. I'll find it.
	Buboy: Hehe! Okay *Kuya*!
	[end_timeline]
- Shoo
	Player: Buboy, please take your carabao elsewhere.
	Buboy: Aww... [pause=1.0]
	Buboy: Okay *Kuya*... come on, *Damulag*!
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Partial
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: Wow, thank you!
Buboy: But I still need the one that [color=#0bb544][pulse]{Transaction.ItemHint}[/pulse][/color].
Buboy: Hehe!

label Satisfy
if {Transaction.WantsDebt}:
	Buboy: Hehe!
	Buboy: Oh wait...
	Buboy: I dropped my coins in the mud earlier!
	Buboy: Hehe!
	Buboy: Is it okay if I pay tomorrow?
	Buboy: I promise Mama will bring the coins!
	- Okay
		Player: That's fine, Buboy. Just tell your Mama.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		Buboy: Hehe! You're the best, *Kuya*!
		Buboy: Let's go, *Damulag*!
	- No
		Player: Sorry Buboy, I can't do that. Go get the coins first.
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		Buboy: Aww...
		Buboy: Okay *Kuya*... I'll be back!
else:
	Buboy: Hehe!
	Buboy: Perfect!
	Buboy: Mama will be so happy!
	Buboy: Thank you, *Kuya*!
	Buboy: Hehe!
	Buboy: Come on, *Damulag*! Let's go home!

label WrongItem
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: Hmm...
Buboy: I don't think that's it!
Buboy: I need the one that [color=#0bb544][pulse]{Transaction.ItemHint}[/pulse][/color].
Buboy: Hehe!
Buboy: Try again, *Kuya*!
